## 2. Current Cleaning Workflow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Upload CSV"] --> B["SchemaProfiler.profile_table()"]
    B --> C["compress_column_meta_for_prompt()"]
    C --> D["LLM: CLEANING_STRATEGY call<br/>System: cleaning.txt"]
    D -->|"Valid JSON"| E["Parse CleaningOperations"]
    D -->|"Invalid/Empty"| F["generate_heuristic_cleaning_ops()<br/>Deterministic fallback"]
    E --> G["order_and_enrich_cleaning_ops()"]
    F --> G
    G --> H["For each op: apply_polars_cleaning_op()"]
    H --> I["Collect LazyFrame → DataFrame"]
    I --> J["Calculate quality scores"]
    J --> K["Write to Parquet + DuckDB"]
    K --> L["Update AgentSwarmState"]
```

